### Eksik: Test Kapsamı
`tests/mcp/tools/status.test.ts` sadece `dependencyGraph` testlerini kapsıyor.
Task'ın istediği 5 test senaryosu eksik:
1. Per-sprint write mode test
2. status.ts sprint-scoped reader (per-sprint file exists → read from there)
3. Backward compat flat mode (flat file only → filter by sprintId tag)
4. Integration: T-150-030 + T-150-038 chain
5. Dashboard live metric fetch (MCP `deckent_status` with metricSnapshot)

